      "writtenOn": "2015-08-26T13:50:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we already have some logic that creates services, and its inherited through the CatalogTests class. It would be awesome to see some of these utility methods consolidated rather than each class in the hierarchy having their own version.\n\nSounds like a good place for a mix-in or just some utility function in CatalogTests.",
