    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "da20952f_cdcbed70",
        "filename": "keystone/tests/unit/test_backend_sql.py",
        "patchSetId": 16
      },
      "lineNbr": 1056,
      "author": {
        "id": 9276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-09-07T10:34:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CatalogTests is not in the SqlCatalogV3 hierarchy as it carries with it a lot of extra tests that don\u0027t work when inherited there.  I agree that there is a need for some improvement/refactoring to the utility methods but perhaps it should be a separate patch set.  I think the utility methods should be separated from actual test methods in the class structure - something that\u0027s not evident in CatalogTests - which itself I think is version (V2/V3) specific.",
      "parentUuid": "fa1b9901_6f43dcaf",
      "revId": "f5482bc5390c4afda01d66a3d5f797a21c704473",
